Derived from: s3s-fs 0.14.1

Changes from that original (2026-09-27):
  - Renamed the package to us-s3gw (library `us_s3gw`).
  - Added a process-wide CAS lock (`cas_lock` in src/fs.rs), held across the
    precondition check and the write in `put_object` and
    `complete_multipart_upload` (src/s3.rs), so an S3 conditional write
    (`If-Match` / `If-None-Match`) is atomic. Upstream performed the check and
    the write with no lock, so concurrent conditional PUTs could both succeed.
  - Added the `US_S3GW_NO_CAS_LOCK` diagnostic switch (src/lib.rs), which only
    exists so the concurrency test can demonstrate the failure the lock prevents.
  - Added README.md.

The original licence text is kept in LICENSE.s3s-fs.
